shapes is module
shapes purpose "Hold the shape types the other modules share"
shapes path geometry.shapes
shapes imports standard.test
shapes exports Rectangle
shapes exports width

Rectangle is record
Rectangle purpose "A rectangle by its side lengths"
Rectangle typeParameter none
Rectangle field width Int64
Rectangle field height Int64

width is operation
width purpose "Return the width of a rectangle"
width invariant returnsWidth "Returns the width field unchanged"
width typeParameter none
width input shape Rectangle copied
width output Int64
width outputOwnedBy none
width raises none
width effect none
width uses none
width memoryHeap false
width async false
width maxRecursion none
width label begin loopKind none
width label begin within none
width let none
width at begin do readWidth
width at begin return ok sideWidth

readWidth is call
readWidth in width
readWidth invokes Rectangle.width
readWidth argument record Rectangle shape copy
readWidth result sideWidth Int64
readWidth ownedBy none
readWidth cleanedBy none
readWidth borrows none
readWidth catch none

hidden is operation
hidden purpose "A helper the module does not export"
hidden invariant none
hidden typeParameter none
hidden input none
hidden output Int64
hidden outputOwnedBy none
hidden raises none
hidden effect none
hidden uses none
hidden memoryHeap false
hidden async false
hidden maxRecursion none
hidden label begin loopKind none
hidden label begin within none
hidden let zero Int64 0 immutable
hidden at begin return ok zero
